{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"402","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Trees in a Row"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The Queen of England has "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" trees growing in a row in her garden. At that, the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ i ≤ n)"},{"kind":"text","text":" tree from the left has height "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" meters. Today the Queen decided to update the scenery of her garden. She wants the trees' heights to meet the condition: for all "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ i < n)"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai + 1 - ai = k"},{"kind":"text","text":", where "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" is the number the Queen chose."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Unfortunately, the royal gardener is not a machine and he cannot fulfill the desire of the Queen instantly! In one minute, the gardener can either decrease the height of a tree to any positive integer height or increase the height of a tree to any positive integer height. How should the royal gardener act to fulfill a whim of Her Majesty in the minimum number of minutes?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two space-separated integers: "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n, k ≤ 1000)"},{"kind":"text","text":". The second line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" space-separated integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a1, a2, ..., an"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ ai ≤ 1000"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the heights of the trees in the row. "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first line print a single integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"p"},{"kind":"text","text":" — the minimum number of minutes the gardener needs. In the next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"p"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines print the description of his actions. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If the gardener needs to increase the height of the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ j ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":") tree from the left by "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(x ≥ 1)"},{"kind":"text","text":" meters, then print in the corresponding line \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ j x"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". If the gardener needs to decrease the height of the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ j ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":") tree from the left by "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(x ≥ 1)"},{"kind":"text","text":" meters, print on the corresponding line \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"- j x"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If there are multiple ways to make a row of trees beautiful in the minimum number of actions, you are allowed to print any of them."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 1\n1 2 1 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n+ 3 2\n- 4 1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 1\n1 2 3 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"402B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/402/problem/B"}